{"seq":1,"slug":"curse-of-dimensionality","title":"维度灾难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/foundations/curse-of-dimensionality","wordCount":1548,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"维度灾难\">维度灾难</h1><p>在二维平面上撒一百个点，它们能相当均匀地覆盖一张纸；把同样一百个点撒进一个一百维的立方体，它们会稀疏到任意两点之间几乎都隔着大片真空。&quot;维度灾难&quot;这个词由 Richard Bellman 在 1957 年研究动态规划时提出，指的正是一类反直觉现象：当维度升高，许多在低维下成立的几何与统计直觉会系统性地崩塌。本篇是整个 hub 唯一系统推导这些性质的地方，后面任何方法解释&quot;为何需要降维&quot;时都会回指到这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>维度灾难不是单一现象，而是几条彼此关联的高维几何性质共同作用的结果。它们可以归结为三条主线：采样变稀疏、体积往边角逃逸、距离趋于相同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[维度 d 升高] --&gt; B[采样稀疏&lt;br/&gt;覆盖空间所需样本指数增长]&#10;  A --&gt; C[体积逃逸&lt;br/&gt;质量集中到边界与角落]&#10;  A --&gt; D[距离集中&lt;br/&gt;最近邻与最远邻趋同]&#10;  B --&gt; E[统计模型&lt;br/&gt;过拟合/估计方差爆炸]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; F[近邻/聚类&lt;br/&gt;相似度失去区分力]&#10;  E --&gt; G[需要降维]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[维度 d 升高] --&gt; B[采样稀疏&lt;br/&gt;覆盖空间所需样本指数增长]\n  A --&gt; C[体积逃逸&lt;br/&gt;质量集中到边界与角落]\n  A --&gt; D[距离集中&lt;br/&gt;最近邻与最远邻趋同]\n  B --&gt; E[统计模型&lt;br/&gt;过拟合/估计方差爆炸]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; F[近邻/聚类&lt;br/&gt;相似度失去区分力]\n  E --&gt; G[需要降维]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>下表把三条主线与它们直接拖垮的下游任务对应起来，方便快速定位&quot;我的问题属于哪一类灾难&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>数学根源</th>\n<th>受影响最严重的任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样稀疏</td>\n<td>覆盖单位立方体所需样本随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 指数增长</td>\n<td>密度估计、非参数回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积逃逸</td>\n<td>高维球体积占比趋于零，质量集中在薄壳</td>\n<td>高斯假设、基于中心的模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离集中</td>\n<td>距离的相对方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 趋于零</td>\n<td>kNN、聚类、相似度检索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采样稀疏-指数级的样本需求\">采样稀疏：指数级的样本需求</h2><p>设想把每个维度切成 10 个等宽的格子来估计数据密度。一维时有 10 个格子，二维 100 个，到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个。要让每个格子里平均落到哪怕一个样本，所需样本量就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——十维已经是一百亿。这就是为什么非参数方法（核密度估计、最近邻回归）在高维下几乎注定失败：你永远凑不齐足够的样本来填满空间。</p>\n<p>换个角度看同一件事：固定样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，要让落在某个边长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的小邻域内的样本占比达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，需要的边长是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = p^{1/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>0.01</mn><mn>0.01</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.955</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 0.01^{0.01} \\approx 0.955</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.955</span></span></span></span></span>。也就是说，为了圈住区区 1% 的数据，你的&quot;局部&quot;邻域得覆盖每个维度 95.5% 的范围——所谓&quot;局部&quot;已经名存实亡。任何依赖&quot;邻域足够小所以足够局部&quot;的方法都会在这里失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体积逃逸-质量躲到薄壳与角落\">体积逃逸：质量躲到薄壳与角落</h2><p>高维球的体积有个惊人性质。半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维球体积正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，于是半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.99</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.99r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的内层球占整球体积的比例是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.99</mn><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.99^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 时这个比例不到 0.7%——也就是说超过 99% 的体积挤在最外那层厚度仅 1% 的薄壳里。均匀采样高维球，几乎所有点都贴着表面。</p>\n<p>再看球与外接立方体的体积比。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维单位球占边长为 2 的立方体的比例随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 迅速趋于零：二维约 0.785，三维约 0.524，到十维已不足 0.0025。体积几乎全部逃进了立方体的角落。这直接动摇了很多建模假设——以一个中心点加各向同性扩散来描述数据（如标准高斯）的图景，在高维里根本不符合数据真实的分布形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"距离集中-最近和最远变得一样近\">距离集中：最近和最远变得一样近</h2><p>也许最违反直觉的，是距离本身失去区分力。对独立同分布的高维随机点，可以证明最近邻距离与最远邻距离的比值趋于 1：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lim_{d \\to \\infty} \\frac{\\max_i \\lVert x_i - q \\rVert - \\min_i \\lVert x_i - q \\rVert}{\\min_i \\lVert x_i - q \\rVert} \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7521em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观说，当维度极高，查询点到所有数据点的距离几乎都挤成同一个值。&quot;最近邻&quot;这个概念因此变得空洞——既然所有点都差不多远，基于距离的检索、kNN 分类、以距离为相似度的聚类就都丧失了判别力。这也解释了为什么在高维下应当慎用欧氏距离，以及为什么先降维再做近邻往往比直接在原空间做更靠谱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"灾难的另一面-内在维度通常很低\">灾难的另一面：内在维度通常很低</h2><p>把上面几节连起来读，结论似乎很悲观。但真实数据有个救赎性的事实：它们极少均匀填满高维空间。一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\times1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 的人脸图名义上有一百万维，但人脸受少数几个因素（身份、表情、光照、角度）支配，真正能变化的自由度远小于一百万。数据其实贴在一张维度低得多的流形上，这个低维数就是数据的<strong>内在维度</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>名义维度</th>\n<th>内在维度（量级）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MNIST 手写数字</td>\n<td>784</td>\n<td>~10–15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然人脸图像</td>\n<td>数十万–百万</td>\n<td>~数十</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本 TF-IDF</td>\n<td>数万–数十万</td>\n<td>~数百</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>维度灾难描述的是名义维度带来的麻烦，内在维度低则是降维之所以可能、之所以有效的根本原因。后面所有方法——无论线性的 <a href=\"../linear-methods/pca\">PCA</a> 还是非线性的 <a href=\"../manifold-learning/tsne\">t-SNE</a> 和 <a href=\"../manifold-learning/umap\">UMAP</a>——本质上都在做同一件事：把数据从拖累它的名义维度，搬回它真正栖身的内在维度。至于这件事究竟能换回哪些具体收益，见 <a href=\"why-reduce-dimensions\">为什么降维</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>维度灾难是几条高维几何性质的合称，不是单一现象。</li>\n<li><strong>采样稀疏</strong>：覆盖空间所需样本随维度指数增长，非参数方法首当其冲。</li>\n<li><strong>体积逃逸</strong>：高维体积集中到薄壳与角落，动摇各向同性、中心化的建模假设。</li>\n<li><strong>距离集中</strong>：最近邻与最远邻趋同，基于距离的方法丧失判别力。</li>\n<li>救赎在于真实数据的<strong>内在维度</strong>远低于名义维度——它们贴在低维流形上。</li>\n<li>降维的全部正当性都来自这一点：把数据搬回它真正栖身的低维空间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维度灾难","id":"维度灾难"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采样稀疏：指数级的样本需求","id":"采样稀疏-指数级的样本需求"},{"level":2,"text":"体积逃逸：质量躲到薄壳与角落","id":"体积逃逸-质量躲到薄壳与角落"},{"level":2,"text":"距离集中：最近和最远变得一样近","id":"距离集中-最近和最远变得一样近"},{"level":2,"text":"灾难的另一面：内在维度通常很低","id":"灾难的另一面-内在维度通常很低"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"为什么降维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/dimensionality-reduction/foundations/why-reduce-dimensions"}}